            "paragraph": "Model description. We used version 3 of the climate model EC-Earth35 to design numerical simulations of the preindustrial and the mid-holocene climates. The atmospheric model is based on the Integrated Forecast System (IFS cycle 36r4) developed by the European Centre for Medium-range Weather Forecasts, including the H-TESSEL land model. The simulation is run at T159 horizontal spectral resolution (roughly 1.125\u00b0 \u00d7 1.125\u00b0) with 62 vertical levels. The ocean model is version 3.3.1 of the Ocean General Circulation Model-NEMO58.",
